title: Projects
---
body:

This is a collection of open-source projects I am currently working on (as of 2026). They are mostly focused on LLM Agents.

## [Clojure System Prompt](https://github.com/iwillig/clojure-system-prompt)

An LLM system prompt focused on the Clojure language

## [Awesome Clojure LLM](https://github.com/iwillig/awesome-clojure-llm)

A collection of tools from the Clojure community related to using LLMs

## [Agentic Engineering with Clojure](https://www.iwillig.me/agentic-engineering-with-clojure/)

A manual for working with the Clojure programming language and LLM agents.



